Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Freedom's Flame Premium Warbond|Freedom's Flame]] page of the [[Superstore#Permanent_Catalog|Permanent Catalog]] on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|250|notext}} and 125 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

